# The topology lint carries a regex whose source once held a bare carriage
# return, which made git classify the whole file as binary and silently skip
# end-of-line normalization: a Windows edit committed it with CRLF and the
# artifact-reproducibility whitespace stage failed on every line. Declaring it
# text pins the stored form regardless of the content heuristic; eol=lf keeps
# the checkout bytes it has today.
paper_topology_lint.ps1 text eol=lf
